WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.500
Himeka-chan and the Fortunetelling Glasses Guy

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.410
Then we should kiss…

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:47.650
W-What should I do?

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:49.500
Did someone see us?

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:55.090
Thank goodness, no one saw…

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:56.560
Water…

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.790
No, this is, um…

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:02.390
Well, Kazune-kun just suddenly ki-

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:04.340
Kissed you?

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:07.550
It doesn't count as a kiss…

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:10.270
but even if I say that…

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:13.800
Why were you kissing?

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.380
Huh? Kazune-kun!

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:22.900
Hanazono-san's hand print!

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:25.820
Y-Yeah…

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:29.860
Huh? Himeka-sama?

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:32.110
Going to sleep already?

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:47.050
Kazune-chan…

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:49.080
kissed.

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:54.470
Good morning!

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:58.310
Good morning, Karin-chan.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.060
Good morning!

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.940
Himeka-chan, are you feeling okay?

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:04.560
I could've made breakfast…

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:08.630
No… I'm  fine.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:13.240
When I move around…

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:17.180
I feel better.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:21.850
Himeka-chan! You put too much ketchup on!

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.060
Oh no!

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:30.090
Oh, that's right.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:32.800
Since breakfast is ready…

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:36.950
can you go tell Kazune-chan?

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.520
What should I do?

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:45.410
My heart's beating so fast.

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:47.940
At times like this…

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:50.960
I should just act natural! Natural!

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.710
O-O-Ouch…

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.420
You got me.

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:07.960
Next round, let's go!

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:10.090
Eh, wait… Can we take a little break?

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:12.550
You just had a break a few minutes ago.

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:14.930
Oh, was that a break?

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:17.800
Ah! Good morning, Hanazono-san!

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.870
Good morning, Micchi.

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:25.190
Kazune-kun's going to be teaching me karate while I'm here.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.940
Ah, I see.

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.440
Come on, let's go!

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:33.280
Nishikiyori, you have to hurry and learn how to transform.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:35.250
Yeah, I'll do my best!

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:40.090
Next!

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.290
Not a chance.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:44.960
Karin, you want to have a go?

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.290
No…

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:48.040
Kazune-kun…

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:51.130
Um… that is…

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:53.590
about last night…

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:55.420
you know…

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.260
Last night?

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:58.550
What about last night?

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:02.950
Eh? Could it be he doesn't remember anything?

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:22.330
Nii-san, that ring has too much power…

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:23.660
It's dangerous.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:25.680
You're right.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:29.720
We can't use it properly, it seems.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:35.130
He left behind something troublesome…

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:36.760
that person did.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:41.780
But… this ring… maybe…

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:47.530
I can use it to catch that Nishikiyori.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:15.940
Who might you be?

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:18.260
I'm not "Who might you be"!

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:19.690
I'm Karasuma-

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:23.100
T-That's right.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.930
Right now, I'm in the perfect disguise.

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:27.990
There's no way she can know.

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:32.270
I'm a humble fortuneteller.

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:36.020
A humble fortuneteller?

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:38.240
I tell people what might happen in the future-

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.630
I know.

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.280
So then…

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:47.260
My goal this time was to find out about Nishikiyori Michiru.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:48.910
Excuse me.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:51.750
Fortuneteller-san…

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.960
I… right now…

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:57.920
Yes, what might be wrong?

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:01.430
I… right now…

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:03.590
Yes, I heard that part.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:08.810
I'm really wondering about something…

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.560
Let me guess.

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:12.560
What you're worried about…

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:14.230
are…

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:16.230
Are?..

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:19.400
…your studies!

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:20.710
No.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.610
I meant…

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:24.950
your diet, of course!

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:26.170
No.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.700
I meant…

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:30.620
about bugs?

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:32.460
That's not it.

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:35.170
Then that must mean…

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.850
in other words… you're worried about love?

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:45.760
How did you know?

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:47.800
Because I'm a fortuneteller.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:50.220
Amazing!

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:55.730
Rather than that, I have to find Nishikiyori Michiru…

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:58.290
Where's Nishikiyori's room?

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:01.400
Fortuneteller-san…

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:04.820
are you looking for something?

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:07.120
Huh? Um…

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:11.390
I'm looking for the answer to your love-worries.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:18.290
Then, in this house?

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:23.920
Yes, exactly! The answer you are looking for lies in this house.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:26.220
Amazing!

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:30.640
You knew that much.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:33.270
Of course, because I'm a fortuneteller.

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:37.280
Hey, how much time must I waste with her?!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:39.750
Alright!

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:42.920
T-This is…

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.880
Did she write this?

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:51.760
Himeka-chan!

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.830
Karin-chan.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:57.040
Is there a guest?

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:00.230
Yes, that's right.

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:03.590
Huh?

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:08.180
That was the god-transform data my father was researching…

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:10.780
But why would that Himeka?..

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:12.860
Huh?

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:19.610
Where did Fortuneteller-san go?

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:21.520
Fortuneteller-san?

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.580
He was amazing.

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:30.070
Fortuneteller-san knew everything.

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.160
Really?..

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:37.100
There was something else I wanted to ask him though.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:41.590
You know, Karin-chan…

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:46.810
last night, I saw it.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:50.940
Saw what?

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:58.060
Kazune-chan was…

00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:59.990
kissing someone.

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:05.320
H-Himeka-chan saw!

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.780
W-What should I do?

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:16.580
But I didn't see who he was kissing.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:21.050
Eh?.. She didn't notice that it was me?

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:26.630
Fortuneteller-san said…

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:32.090
the person he was kissing is in this house.

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:34.240
I-I see.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:36.810
This is bad.

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:40.190
I can't tell Himeka-chan the truth!

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:41.990
Leave it to me!

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:48.530
I'll definitely find the culprit hiding in this house.

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:49.950
What're you talking about?

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.320
There's no way you can do that, Shii-chan-

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:54.880
I am a goddess after all, this is my work.

00:10:56.660 --> 00:11:00.230
Kazune-kun!

00:10:57.040 --> 00:11:01.420
Suspect #1: Nishikiyori Michiru.

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:05.000
The one who kisses his friends, that's Micchi.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:04.610
Hey, what are you-

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:08.300
Suspect #2: Kyuu-chan.

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:12.470
Kazune-sama, please take this as a symbol of my gratitude.

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:14.610
Oh! Mentaiko, huh?

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:19.180
Like this, Kyuu-chan can make Kazune-kun's heart throb…

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:20.740
Or maybe it was…

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:25.110
Suspect #3: The mentaiko from Hakata!

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:27.190
Isn't that the same?

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:28.900
Or suspect #4:

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:32.070
Ah! A bug!

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:35.200
The bug that makes his heart beat quickly is the most suspicious.

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:37.790
I don't think it makes his heart beat like "that".

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:39.040
And then there's…

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:41.210
the most suspicious of all.

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:42.810
Suspect #5:

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:45.310
You!

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:48.550
The bird on Karin's head!

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:49.380
Huh?

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:52.470
How tasty looking!

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:55.010
Come here, birdie!

00:11:57.010 --> 00:12:02.660
I have no idea who it could be.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:08.860
I don't know what to do anymore…

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:10.440
Hey, Kazune-kun…

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:13.590
you kissed Hanazono-san didn't you?

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.670
That face tells me I'm right.

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:20.330
Y-Yeah…

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:22.410
What? He did remember!

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:24.810
Even though he said he didn't!..

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:30.250
But… I just suddenly kissed her even though I'm not the one she likes…

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.190
Huh?

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:38.360
Not the one I like?..

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:41.700
No way…

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:44.030
That's not true…

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:53.720
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.260
I am God!

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:02.220
You moron.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:02.220
It's a croquette!

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:19.470
I would've brought an umbrella if I knew this would happen.

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:23.810
Ah! Fortuneteller-san!

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:28.690
O-Oh, we meet again.

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:31.270
Thank goodness.

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:36.920
I had something I wanted to ask you about.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:39.700
Ask anything you want.

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.410
What?!

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:46.010
Someone kissed Kujyou!?

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:54.050
You knew that of course though, right?

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:56.420
O-Of course…

00:13:58.130 --> 00:14:00.970
I-I didn't know…

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:03.890
that Kujyou was into that sort of stuff.

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:06.560
Fortuneteller-san…

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:14.460
please tell me who kissed Kazune-chan.

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:18.130
I beg of you.

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:21.240
Of course it's worrisome…

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:25.220
but why should it matter to me?

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:35.960
This magic die will surely find out the truth.

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.360
Amazing!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:43.860
I wonder if I should really be doing this.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.680
Can I ask you something?

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:49.890
Yes.

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:53.810
Once you find out who kissed Kujyou Kazune…

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:56.650
what do you intend to do?

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:57.740
Huh?

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:01.050
I'm saying do you really want to know?

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.090
Himeka?

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:49.370
Himeka!

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:10.470
This is…

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:11.780
Kazune-kun!

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:25.510
Himeka-chan!

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:29.580
Hey, what did you do to Himeka-chan?!

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:33.620
Oh, it's shocking for someone to be out in this weather.

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:34.960
What are you talking about,…

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:37.080
fake fortunetelling glasses guy!

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:39.170
I'm not "fake fortunetelling glasses guy"!

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:40.880
I'm Karasuma Kirio!

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.760
Oh, dammit…

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:45.970
She saw through my perfect disguise.

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:47.340
Not bad, amateur goddess.

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:49.510
It's obvious no matter how you look at it.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:51.950
Himeka-chan, hurry and run away!

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:56.660
Battle Transformation, using Hades' Power!

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:00.000
Himeka-chan?

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.350
Kazune-kun!

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.850
Such power…

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:29.490
Don't move.

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:36.700
If you want to save Himeka, don't move a muscle.

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:45.740
Himeka-chan!

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:47.250
Himeka!

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.080
Himeka!

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:58.600
Himeka-chan!

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:22.330
The one who kissed Kazune-chan was…

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:27.360
Karin-chan…

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:32.220
No, um… it's not what you think.

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:37.450
Thank goodness, that's all.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:39.050
Huh?

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:42.770
It's not over.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.840
Kujyou!

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:48.090
Nishikiyori, take care of Himeka.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:49.270
I got it.

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.520
Ego sumo deus!

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:58.810
I am God!

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:03.290
Kazune-chan! Karin-chan!

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:07.530
Be careful.

00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:08.440
Okay!

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:09.880
Leave it to us!

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:16.340
- Karin, let's retreat a little.

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:16.340
- Yeah!

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:19.300
Wait!

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:36.320
Hey!

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:40.780
Kazune-kun!

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:45.500
He went down even faster than before.

00:19:46.270 --> 00:19:49.860
I have all I need to beat you.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:52.460
You mean to say you still have power!?

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.650
Karin!

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:17.110
I'll dispose of her first.

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:20.370
Like I'll let you!

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:34.570
Let's stop playing around…

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:37.760
and finish this once and for all.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.640
Kazune-kun, if you use that much power, you'll…

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:57.820
Himeka…

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:17.460
With this, you can't ever go into god-mode again…

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:19.510
I'll remember this.

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:25.260
We did… it-

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:28.180
Kazune-kun!

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:33.260
Kazune-kun!

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:37.690
Kazune-kun… is so cold…

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:39.990
And he looks so pale!

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:45.200
…it will become dangerous if he keeps on transforming as often as he has been lately.

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:48.500
Kazune-kun, hold on!

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:52.070
Somehow, I'm…

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:54.610
kinda scared…

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:56.990
now that I've beat him…

00:21:56.990 --> 00:21:59.340
at this rate, I…

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:02.580
Please, Karin…

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:04.130
stay with me…

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:07.970
He's so cold… He feels like ice.

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:16.630
Somehow…

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:18.780
it's different than usual…

00:22:19.220 --> 00:22:21.050
Kazune-kun.

00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:21.760
Karin…

00:22:22.600 --> 00:22:24.270
stay with me.

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:26.910
Kazune-kun, I'll protect you…

00:22:27.640 --> 00:22:31.910
Kazune-kun… because I…

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:11.370
Kazune-kun? And the Festival
